{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13104250","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13104250","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1310425001:1":{"text":"女士们，先生们，这位就是今年祭典的“受选者”！","source_cn":"女士们，先生们，这位就是今年祭典的“受选者”！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2F62E1097932E1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310425002:1":{"text":"舞会结束后，请大家前往仪式现场，一起见证冬日祭典中最为荣耀和神圣的时刻！","source_cn":"舞会结束后，请大家前往仪式现场，一起见证冬日祭典中最为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9F8006D4DD6F47B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310425003:0":{"text":"对了，你们还不知道吧，点火之前，“受选者”需要为冰雕献上<style=\"highlight\">七瓣蓝绒花</style>！","source_cn":"对了，你们还不知道吧，点火之前，“受选者”需要为冰雕献...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D7B456BFB361E1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310425004:1":{"text":"可是……公主殿下，蓝绒花不是六瓣的吗？","source_cn":"可是……公主殿下，蓝绒花不是六瓣的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE8AD3E779082288","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310425005:1":{"text":"是呀！但是也有七瓣的蓝绒花。在白山，七瓣的蓝绒花是<style=\"highlight\">“奇迹”的象征</style>，寄托着古代英雄的意志。","source_cn":"是呀！但是也有七瓣的蓝绒花。在白山，七瓣的蓝绒花是<s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB57C58F4671594B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1310425006:1":{"text":"历史老师说，过去与恶魔的抗争非常惨烈，几乎是不可能赢的战争。","source_cn":"历史老师说，过去与恶魔的抗争非常惨烈，几乎是不可能赢的战争。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8764C2F7E06C4D53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310425007:1":{"text":"但是，“奇迹”发生了——古代的英雄们最终赢得了胜利。","source_cn":"但是，“奇迹”发生了——古代的英雄们最终赢得了胜利。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16AA9B900E407EEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310425008:1":{"text":"在渺小得可怜的概率下战胜恶魔，与在几万分之一的概率下生出第七瓣花，虽然是美丽又浪漫的巧合，但大家都愿意相信。","source_cn":"在渺小得可怜的概率下战胜恶魔，与在几万分之一的概率下生...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FE4F4E9CFEE44A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310425009:1":{"text":"毕竟，谁不需要一点好运呢！","source_cn":"毕竟，谁不需要一点好运呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E33D3C7F9493B34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1310425009":{"text":"毕竟，谁不需要一点好运呢！","source_cn":"毕竟，谁不需要一点好运呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E33D3C7F9493B34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_ti